  "guid": "ciallo.repairextension",
  "name": "Repair Skill Extension",
  "slug": "repair-skill-extension",
  "teaser": "Custom higher buff chance for repairing armor & weapon. Repair skills work on all armor items. Fully repaired at once.",
  "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/FtPFwAPARxPTl07MIjDicoXwm02eOdy4tcQLMflm.png",
  "downloads": 7287,
  "favourites_count": 33,
  "description": "<h1>What This Mod Does</h1>\n<ul>\n<li>Change the enhancement chance &amp; buff effect while repairing by Kit.</li>\n<li>Allow repair skills gain EXP and add DmgReduce for repairing Facecover, Visor.</li>\n<li>Items get full durability by one repairing, no need to repair again and again.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>My preset value:</h3>\n<p>You can edit <strong>buffs.jsonc</strong> in mod’s folder to change buff chance &amp; effect.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>linearly increase buff chance from 35% to 100% at corresponding skill Lv.10-51 (If &lt;Lv.10, no buff allowed by vanilla EFT)</li>\n<li>Armor &amp; weapon keep buff in longer durability (80-95% of total)</li>\n<li>Armor’s damage reduce is normal=10-15%, rare=25-30%</li>\n<li>Weapon’s spread decrease is normal=10-15%, rare=25-30%</li>\n<li>Weapon’s malfchance decrease is normal=20-25%, rare=40-50%</li>\n</ul>\n<h1>How to install</h1>\n<p>Download and drag files to your EFT folder, you should see dll and jsonc config in<br />\nYour_EFT_Folder\\SPT\\user\\mods\\RepairSkillExtension\\</p>\n<h3>How to remove</h3>\n<p>Just delete this folder in user\\mods. You can leave any buffed items in inventory.</p>\n",
  "detail_url": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2556/repair-skill-extension",
